{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13474","headline":"泊舟盱眙 · 韦建","name":"泊舟盱眙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"泊舟淮水次，霜降夕流清。\n夜久潮浸岸，天寒月近城。\n平沙依鴈宿，候馆听鸡鸣。\n乡国云霄外，谁堪羁旅情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13474.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13474","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}